From 9fbdfedb14bdd614309fc4a080baf573b1531237 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Sophie Winter [AI]" <git@phie.me>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 02:09:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Prototype: tsc 6/7 stable type ordering (union member order
 by compareTypes, object literal props by declaration)

Time-boxed derisking prototype on top of the TS 6.0.3 prototype (471175dc), measured against the tsgo-port
baselines (4d4f005c, stableTypeOrdering on). New src/ty/order.c: ty_compare(), a port of checker.ts's compareTypes
(TS 6 TypeFlags rank, compareTypeNames by alias/type-param/class/interface/reference name, object symbol declaration
order (file program_order, then position), tuple shape, type argument lists, literal values, enum member/unique symbol
declarations, union origins, keyof/indexed/substitution/template/string mapping operands, array mappers) with type
id as the final tie-break (and for conditional roots, deferred reference nodes: tttt keeps no node there).
sort_by_id/insert_by_id/sorted_contains/sorted_list_contains/union_has_member, the constrained-type-variable
re-insertion and the optional-marker scan use it instead of ids. Object literal (and spread) types sort their props
by declaration position (getNamedMembers), props without one last by name.

Suite (results file = tsgo-port baselines): 13220 -> 13790 / 14969 (errors 14490 -> 14546, types 13509 -> 14082).
Lost 3: stableTypeOrdering(stabletypeordering=false) (option not honoured: no id-order fallback), and
selfReferencingSpreadInLoop / yieldExpressionInControlFlow (TS7034/TS7005: ty_array()'s "autoArray has the lowest id
so it survives subtype reduction" no longer holds: Array<any> now sorts before Array<auto>). Left of the 576
order-only tests that passed against 6.0.3: 8 (class static side `prototype` member order: tsc 6 lists it after
the class's own members; moving it broke a declared `static prototype`, reverted; deeplyNestedMappedTypes).
Perf (callgrind, --checkers 1): tsc +11.5%, drizzle +6.1%, type-fest +4.5%, zod +3.5%, vue +2.6%, effect +1.3%:
ty_compare is ~9.5% inclusive on tsc's src/compiler (sort + is-sorted checks). Needs a cached sort key per type.
valibot gains 4 TS2344 in keyof.test-d.ts that tsgo 7.0.2 reports identically (UnionToTuple-style order dependence).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
